B = [
('Yash Raj Films','South Asia','1990s-2000s','film','In the style of Yash Raj Films, glossy, luminous, lavishly romantic cinema where everything is staged to look glamorous and aspirational. Saturated, jewel-bright colour with golden mustard yellows, rich reds and crisp snowy whites, soft backlight with a gentle glow and lens flare, and wide open scenic backdrops of fields and mountains. Flowing sheer fabrics in red and yellow swirl in the air, outfits are polished and fashionable, and settings are opulent and spotless. Title lettering is bright, swashing and decorative in script and gold. Heartfelt, dreamy, optimistic, with a polished late 1990s feel.'),
('Nollywood','Africa','2000s-present','film','In the style of Nollywood, high-energy, melodramatic, richly saturated imagery built as dramatic collage compositions. Large overlapping close-up faces with intense theatrical expressions, hand-painted or digitally composited layering, glowing gold and fiery red accents, and heavy glossy gradient titles with bevel, outline and drop shadow. Bold West African wax-print and woven cloth patterns, elaborate sculpted head wraps, abundant jewellery and showy displays of wealth, with bright daylight and crowded frames. Emotion is turned up to the maximum, colours are loud and shiny, and the finish has a lively, direct-to-viewer, early digital home-video energy.'),
('Shaw Brothers','East Asia','1960s-70s','film','In the style of Shaw Brothers, colour-saturated studio-made period drama where everything is clearly built on a sound stage. Painted backdrops, theatrical fog, artificial lighting and stylised sets of bamboo, courtyards and lanterns. Vivid reds, yellows and jade greens, silk costumes with rich embroidery, and bold dramatic action poses. Fast snap zooms and sweeping choreographed movement. Posters are hand-painted with brushed calligraphic titles and exaggerated, pulpy emotion. Heightened, operatic, vividly coloured and gloriously artificial, with a 1970s Hong Kong pulp feel and a slightly grainy film-stock warmth.'),
('Studio Pierrot','East Asia','1980s-2000s','animation','In the style of Studio Pierrot, lively, fashionable television anime with long-limbed, slender characters, sharp expressive eyes and stylish, spiky or flowing hair. Clean cel-shaded linework with flat colour fills, bold headbands, trailing scarves and glowing energy effects. Saturated sky blue, orange and violet backgrounds, dynamic action poses with speed lines and wind streaks, and wholesome adventurous scenery. Costume and character design is colourful and trendy, with a youthful, upbeat and slightly dramatic mood. Hand-drawn cel texture, gentle film softness and the look of 1980s to early 2000s broadcast animation.'),
('Ubisoft','Europe','2000s-present','video games','In the style of Ubisoft, polished, high-budget blockbuster open-world visuals with vast sweeping vistas viewed from a high vantage point and a sense of freedom and scale. Richly detailed, sunlit settings in saturated golden-hour skies, with a hero shown as a dynamic leaping silhouette, often hooded or in period dress. Cinematic key art graded in teal and orange. Interfaces are clean and minimal, with simple blue and white icons and glowing map markers. Titles use bold, clean sans-serif lettering. Lush, immersive, adventurous, glossy and confidently cinematic.'),
('Rockstar Games','North America','2000s-present','video games','In the style of Rockstar Games, gritty, lived-in, cinematic realism with a satirical edge. Sun-bleached streets, smoggy sunsets, cluttered signage and billboards, grainy handheld-camera feel and heavy atmospheric haze. Key art is organised as a grid of stylised comic-like panels with thick black outlines and flat saturated colour. Lettering is stark, in yellow and black or gold and white. Colour moods swing between dusty western earth tones and retro pastel neon. Raw, cynical, sweaty and sharply observed, with a worn print-and-poster finish that feels like a slightly lurid, rebellious portrait of society.'),
('Blizzard','North America','1990s-present','video games','In the style of Blizzard, exaggerated, heroic, comic-epic fantasy and science fiction with chunky, stylised proportions. Oversized armour, huge shoulder plates and enormous weapons, painterly saturated textures with hand-painted highlights, and glowing magical effects in cyan, orange and violet. Interface frames are rich stone and metal trimmed in gold, with bevelled edges. Hero poses are dramatic and low-angle, towering against the viewer. Logo lettering is ornate, bevelled and metallic. Bold, polished, vibrant and larger than life, with strong silhouettes that read instantly and a confident sense of fun.'),
('FromSoftware','East Asia','2009-present','video games','In the style of FromSoftware, bleak, decaying dark-fantasy atmosphere where beauty survives only as ruin. Crumbling gothic architecture, fog-filled distances, battered, tarnished armour, tattered cloaks and grotesque, towering monstrous forms. Desaturated palette of ash grey, rust brown and sickly green, broken by a single shaft or glow of warm golden light. Sparse, moody lighting with deep shadow and heavy atmosphere. Any text is small, plain and elegant in a quiet serif face. Intricate weathered detail on every surface. Melancholic, ominous, lonely and solemn, with scale that makes the viewer feel small.'),
('Naughty Dog','North America','2000s-present','video games','In the style of Naughty Dog, cinematic, emotionally grounded third-person realism with photoreal characters and detailed faces that carry the performance. Ruined or overgrown settings with ivy, rust and humid greenery, warm sun-dappled light, shallow depth of field and floating dust in the air. Everything has a worn, lived-in feel with scars, grime, scuffed gear and practical clothing. Colour is graded in teal and orange. Key art is blockbuster in feel with clean, minimal white titles. Human, tense, adventurous and tender, with a filmic polish.'),
('Valve','North America','2000s-present','video games','In the style of Valve, witty, stylised and slightly gritty retro-futurist design with a limited palette of muted orange and cyan accents. Clean industrial interiors with white tile, panels and orange hazard markings. Bold, flat-shaded poster art with strong silhouettes and a propaganda-poster feel, hand-painted figures with exaggerated, caricatured character, and simple circular or symbol-based logos in orange. Orange-yellow warning signage and clear, functional graphic marks. Shapes are chunky and confident, surfaces slightly dirty, and the mood is dry-humoured, clever and sinister, with a mid-century science-fiction sensibility.'),
('Supreme','North America','1990s-present','streetwear','In the style of Supreme, a flat rectangular label in saturated red with bold white italic capitals in a heavy, squeezed sans-serif face, used as a stamp that can appear on anything and be repeated or tiled as a pattern. Collage graphics of found photographs, crude photocopy halftones, high-contrast black and white portraits, cartoon figures and gallery-style reproductions, always with the red rectangle in a corner. Palette of red, black, white and occasional neon. Crisp screen-print ink, slightly cracked vinyl texture, thick outlines and deadpan minimal copy. Clean white retail spaces and a hard-edged downtown street-poster attitude, cool, smug and deliberately ironic.'),
('Off-White','Europe','2010s','streetwear','In the style of Off-White, an industrial, deconstructed luxury mood built on quotation marks placed around ordinary words in plain, neutral capital sans-serif lettering, as if labelling the object. Diagonal yellow and black hazard stripes, arrows with crossed diagonal bars, plastic zip ties used as tags, exposed construction tape, orange safety webbing, raw seams and large printed words. Matte black, white and off-white with photocopy-grey graphics and caution-tape or road-marking motifs. Parts are shown half-finished, with visible foam, extra laces and printed labels. Sharp minimal layouts on white gallery-like backdrops, ironic, labelled and quietly rebellious.'),
('Stussy','North America','1980s-90s','streetwear','In the style of Stussy, a fast, hand-scrawled marker signature with a slanted pen stroke and loose underline, in black or white, used as the main mark. Relaxed, boxy, laid-back shapes in washed black, faded navy, cream and olive with bright primary accents. Surf-shop graphics such as palm trees, dice, chess pieces, flowers, tribal stripe patterns and reggae colours, screen printed with a slightly cracked vintage finish. Collage energy mixing surf, skate, hip hop and club flyer influences, with offset print grain, rough photocopy borders and DIY edges. Sun-faded, casual, cool and unforced, with a 1990s street feel.'),
('Vans','North America','1970s-present','footwear','In the style of Vans, low-profile, flat, rugged skate-shoe design with a thick white vulcanised rubber waffle sole, a tall white foxing stripe wrapping the sole edge, a rounded toe cap and flat cotton laces. Sturdy double-stitched duck canvas, suede panels on tougher versions and padded collars. Colours in solid navy, black, red, olive and white, with a black and white checkerboard of small squares as a signature pattern. A small rectangular red label with white italic lettering sits at the heel, and a wavy contrasting stripe runs along the side. Skull-and-crossbone prints, slightly scuffed, well worn, with off-the-wall California skate-park attitude.'),
('Converse', 'North America', '1920s-present', 'general', 'In the style of Converse, plain, friendly mid-century American sporting simplicity for any product. Soft, rounded, gently domed shapes with smooth continuous curves. Sturdy, good-quality natural cotton canvas texture, slightly creased and lightly worn, in warm off-white, with a glossy off-white band along the lower edge carrying two thin parallel lines, one cherry red and one navy, drawn crisply and evenly. Palette is optic white, natural cream, cherry red and navy, with a touch of mustard and faded pastels. A small simple __bs_simple_shape__ motif sits quietly to one side.'),
('Nike','North America','1970s-present','footwear','In the style of Nike, high-energy athletic design dominated by a single swoosh, a curved checkmark with a thin tapering tail, stitched or moulded in contrasting colour across the side. Sculpted, performance-driven shapes with visible air cushion windows in the heel, waffle-pattern rubber soles, layered mesh, suede and synthetic overlays, chunky midsoles and bold colour blocking in volt yellow, hot orange, royal blue, black and white. Lettering is lowercase, heavy and italic in a geometric bold sans-serif. Sleek technical fabrics with perforations and reflective details. Imagery uses motion photography, dramatic close crops and stark black and white posters with a simple line of white type. Fast, confident and motivating.'),
('New Balance','North America','1980s-90s','footwear','In the style of New Balance, chunky, understated running-shoe design in a restrained palette of heather grey suede and mesh with navy, burgundy or forest green accents. A large slanted capital N in contrasting colour on the side panel is the main mark. Layered suede and breathable mesh panels, thick tapered foam midsoles in off-white, solid heel counters, stitched ribs and a gum or white rubber tread. Tonal grey monochrome versions with only hints of colour at lace loops and heel tabs. Practical, wide-fit, slightly orthopaedic, honest in craft and unfashionable on purpose, with a dad-shoe quality and 1980s jogging heritage.'),
('Salomon','Europe','1990s-present','outdoor','In the style of Salomon, technical, aggressive, engineered mountain-sport design with sculpted, angular silhouettes. Quick-pull lace systems with plastic toggles and bungee cord, sharp angled protective overlays, lugged chevron outsoles and a prominent rear heel pod. Mixed synthetic mesh, welded overlays and moulded rigid cages in black, charcoal, bright red, electric blue, lime and grey, with a curved wing-like mark in contrasting colour. Winter gear in glossy plastic shells with hard geometric ribs and metal buckles. A mix of matte and gloss, fast, slightly futuristic, set against stark white photographic backgrounds with a precise athlete feel.'),
('Arcteryx','North America','1990s-present','outdoor','In the style of Arcteryx, minimalist, precise technical outerwear with clean unbroken surfaces and very few visible seams. Taped waterproof seams, sleek watertight zippers under flat storm flaps, sculpted articulated hoods with a stiffened brim and laser-cut edges, and no extra clutter. Matte laminated fabric in subdued black, graphite, deep navy, slate blue, burnt orange and glacier white, with sharp colour blocking on the shoulders and tiny tonal pullers. A small stylised skeletal bird mark sits quietly on the chest. Tailored athletic cut, quiet and expensive, shot against wet, dramatic alpine scenery in muted desaturated tones.'),
('The North Face','North America','1980s-90s','outdoor','In the style of The North Face, bold, chunky expedition design with strong colour blocking in red, yellow, royal blue, black and white. A mark of three curved quarter-dome lines forming a half circle, with a heavy capital wordmark below, embroidered on the chest. Baffled, quilted, boxy nylon shells with hoods, drawcords, visible zipper pulls, oversize shoulder panels in contrasting colour, vented underarm zips and sturdy webbing straps. Dome-like structures with curved poles and staked guy lines. Bright primary panels against snowy rock, practical, rugged and tough, with a chunky 1990s mountaineering feel.'),
('Columbia Sportswear','North America','1980s-90s','outdoor','In the style of Columbia Sportswear, practical, layered, weather-ready design with puffy shells and zip-in liners in bold colour-block panels of red, bright blue, yellow, forest green and black, with contrasting yokes and sleeves. Khaki and sage utility pieces with vented back flaps, many small zip pockets and roll-up tab sleeves. A mark of a stylised mountain peak with a capital C embedded, with a bold block wordmark, embroidered on the chest or sleeve. Sturdy nylon ripstop, quilted waterproof outer fabrics, silver dotted reflective lining, big hoods and drawcords. Rainy Pacific Northwest and chunky ski-lodge fashion from the 1990s.'),
('Black Diamond','North America','1990s-present','outdoor','In the style of Black Diamond, precise, high-contrast climbing and mountain equipment with anodised aluminium parts in vivid red, blue, orange, lime green and purple, each machined with rounded shapes, sharp stamped marks and small lightening cutouts. A simple black diamond shape with a bold sans-serif wordmark is the identifying mark. Woven bright geometric patterns on cord, black webbing with colour-accent loops, glossy neon shells with vents and chunky matte black housings with textured grips. Brights pop against matte black fabrics. Technical, industrial and exact, shown on white with strong shadows.'),
('Yeti','North America','2010s-present','outdoor','In the style of Yeti, overbuilt, bombproof, American-outdoors design with thick, rounded rectangular bodies, smooth thick walls and chunky rubber latches, rope handles and tie-down slots. Double-walled stainless steel with powder-coated matte colour in tan, white, navy, charcoal, seafoam, desert clay and bright accents of coral, teal and cream. Tapered cups with simple pill-shaped lids and sturdy rubber feet. A small clean logo with a bold capital wordmark sits in a rounded rectangle badge or is debossed into the body. Clean minimal surfaces, engraved text and a matte, rugged, heavy-duty finish.'),
('Stanley','North America','1913-present','outdoor','In the style of Stanley, rugged, honest working-man design with a rounded cylindrical body, stout shoulders and squat proportions. Hammertone enamel finish in deep forest green with a subtle dimpled stipple texture, with brushed stainless steel parts, a press-fit stopper and a sturdy hinged handle. A small gold or white logo with a block wordmark and a beaded border. Matching pieces in the same green with rolled steel edges, plus cream and navy variants. Slightly dented, workshop-honest, practical and durable, with a mid-century hunting-and-fishing nostalgia.'),
('Thermos','Europe','1900s-1960s','housewares','In the style of Thermos, cheerful, practical picnic design with tall cylindrical bodies in polished steel or red, blue and green enamel, a screw-on cup that doubles as a lid, a plain stopper and a small handle or strap. Plaid cloth in red and green checks, tin cases with colourful printed scenes and domed lids, rounded corners and hinged carry handles. Simple baked enamel paint, shiny nickel rims, embossed lettering and ribbed bands. A mid-century school-lunchroom and countryside-outing mood, bright but slightly worn painted metal.'),
('Zippo','North America','1930s-present','accessories','In the style of Zippo, compact, sturdy pocket objects in highly polished chrome or brushed brass with rounded corners, hinged lids that snap with a click and visible hinge barrels. Engraved or enamelled designs on the face such as eagles, flags, skulls, pin-up silhouettes, flames, military insignia and checkered flat patterns, with date-code stamps on the base. Finishes include black crackle, matte chrome, hammered brass and etched lines. Small blocky capital stamped lettering. Classic American soldier look, slightly scratched metal, with a 1940s to 1970s Americana feel.'),
('Victorinox','Europe','1890s-present','tools','In the style of Victorinox, Swiss precision and functional compactness with handles in glossy translucent or matte signal red, a white cross on a shield emblem inlaid near the top, polished stainless steel parts nested neatly in thin layers between brass bolsters, and a small key-ring loop. Smooth rounded rectangular profiles with a pinched waist and laser-etched small text. Black polymer accents appear on tougher variants. Bright signal red against silver steel, tidy and orderly, with many functions folded into a small body and shown fanned open.'),
('Opinel','Europe','1890s-present','tools','In the style of Opinel, a simple, rustic, honest folding tool with a slim tapered blade in carbon steel and a plain turned beech wood handle shaped like a slim teardrop, finished in clear lacquer. A rotating steel locking ring sits at the base of the blade. A small crowned hand mark is stamped on the blade, a number on the handle. Handles in natural pale beech, olivewood, dark stained wood and occasional coloured lacquer, with a lanyard hole. Thin ground blade, patinated steel, elegant, inexpensive and unfussy, with a countryside peasant-picnic mood, shown on a wooden board with bread and cheese.'),
('Leatherman','North America','1980s-present','tools','In the style of Leatherman, tough, dense, industrial multi-function design built around a core tool whose handles fold over it in channel form, hiding a nested stack of blades and drivers. Brushed or black oxide stainless steel, precise stamped and machined parts, rounded handle edges with perforation holes and etched logo text, a small pocket clip and a snap-on black nylon sheath. Matte bead-blast finish, riveted pivots, accents of orange or coloured anodised aluminium. Heavy, functional and garage-made in spirit, shown open like a fan on a dark workbench.'),
('Maglite','North America','1980s-present','tools','In the style of Maglite, heavy, robust cylindrical forms machined from solid aluminium with a knurled diamond-pattern grip, thick walls and bevelled edges. A twist-on head with a rubber o-ring seal, a small reflector and a tail cap with a tiny lanyard hole. Hard-anodised matte black, with colour options of red, blue, silver, titanium grey and olive, and engraved capital lettering on the barrel with a faint machining line. A slim flat switch with a rubber button. Police and workshop utility feel, shown on black.'),
('London Underground posters','Europe','1920s-30s','transport','In the style of London Underground posters, flat gouache and lithographic posters with clean, simplified scenes of rolling green hills, cottages, villages and tall stylised trees, with strong silhouettes and bold flat colour. Lettering is a clear geometric sans-serif in carefully balanced capitals with round O shapes. A red circle crossed by a blue horizontal bar on white is used as the identifying sign. Limited palette of poster red, deep blue, mustard yellow, warm brown, sage green and cream. Cubist and Art Deco inspired simplified forms, flat layered planes, generous white margins and printed text beneath the image, serene and optimistic.'),
('Deutsche Bahn','Europe','1990s-present','transport','In the style of Deutsche Bahn, clean, efficient, clinical modern public-transport design with white bodies, a bright red stripe along the lower skirt and light grey roofs and window bands. A logo of two red rounded slanted bars forming a stylised track, in a white rectangle with a red outline. Aerodynamic pointed noses, smooth tapered windows, red doors and sharp clean lines. Signage in white sans-serif capitals on dark grey or red fields, tidy pictograms and neat grid layouts, with yellow information boards. Functionalist, orderly and precise, with polished grey platforms and glass roofs.'),
('SNCF','Europe','1990s-present','transport','In the style of SNCF, polished French modernism with streamlined, pointed-nose forms in a glossy two-tone livery of blue-grey and deep silver or white, accented by a sweeping carmine red or magenta slash. Rounded smooth cabins and slim windows. A bold lowercase wordmark with a rounded slanted ribbon swoosh in raspberry red or carmine on white. Clean pictograms in white on dark blue and carmine, rounded sans-serif lettering, modern glass hall roofs and a cool blue-grey scheme. Elegant, clean curves, fluid and streamlined.'),
('Swiss Federal Railways','Europe','1970s-present','transport','In the style of Swiss Federal Railways, precise, punctual, perfectly legible Swiss modernist design. A red square with a white equal-armed cross and two-way arrows is the main mark. Red and white vehicles with clean rounded stripes. A white analogue clock face on a plain black ring dial, with a thin black minute hand, a bold black hour hand and a red second hand tipped with a disc. Signage in white neutral sans-serif lettering on black or red fields, a perfect grid, bold arrows and pictograms, and tidy timetable sheets in yellow with black text. Polished steel and bright red.'),
('Japan Post','East Asia','1950s-present','postal','In the style of Japan Post, a simple red mark built from a single stylised character with a horizontal bar above it, set in a rounded square or circle, used consistently on boxes, vehicles, uniforms and packaging in red and white. Rounded cylindrical forms with narrow horizontal slots and white sign plates. Small commemorative stamp formats with delicate woodblock print and watercolour scenes of blossom, mountains, seasonal festivals and cute animal characters, thin black outlined frames and small white sans-serif text. Clean, cheerful, polite public-service look with red, white, gold and soft pastel accents.'),
('Royal Mail','Europe','1850s-present','postal','In the style of Royal Mail, traditional Victorian civic pride in deep post-office red glossy enamel on cylindrical cast iron with a domed cap, a horizontal slot with a small canopy, a crown cipher and raised capital lettering in a recessed panel painted in gold or black. Vehicles in red with gold crown logos and bold gold wordmarks on red. Stamps with a small profile silhouette portrait in the upper corner on a coloured field, perforated edges, rich tonal colour and a numeric value in clean figures. Deep red and gold, solid, official and dependable.'),
('USPS stamps','North America','1950s-present','postal','In the style of USPS stamps, small perforated adhesive rectangles with a thin white border, each featuring a single illustrated subject rendered in fine intaglio engraving or in colourful painted illustration. The word USA in clean sans-serif capitals and a face value numeral in white or black are tucked into a corner, with a fine tinted background and delicate cross-hatched engraving lines. Sheets include margin text, plate numbers and flag marks. Patriotic Americana, mid-century commemorative theme, rich fine detail, limited ink palette of blue, red, green and sepia.'),
('NYC Subway signage','North America','1970s-present','transport','In the style of NYC Subway signage, rectangular name signs with bold neutral sans-serif capitals in white on black, with a thin white border line, mounted on tiled walls. Coloured circles or diamonds with a single bold white letter or numeral in red, green, blue, orange, yellow, purple, brown and grey. Glossy white ceramic tiling with coloured mosaic name tablets, steel columns painted dark green and fluorescent-lit tunnels. Tidy arrows, clear hierarchy and a modernist grid-manual look of 1970s transit signage, gritty scuffed steel and tile, strong urban functionalism.'),
('Paris Metro Art Nouveau entrances','Europe','1900s','architecture','In the style of Paris Metro Art Nouveau entrances, Art Nouveau cast iron and glass painted in bottle green, with whiplash curved stems that bend like plant shoots, sinuous railings shaped like flowering vines, and amber glass panels forming a shell or scalloped canopy. Tall lamp standards curve like orchid stems holding glowing amber glass bulbs with organic ribbed forms. Enamelled lava stone plaques with flowing curved lettering and swelling ends. Dragonfly-wing glazed canopies, botanical curves, delicate yet industrial, ornate organic ironwork, deep green with golden light, a belle epoque city mood.'),
('Moscow Metro stations','Russia and Eastern Europe','1930s-50s','architecture','In the style of Moscow Metro stations, palatial underground halls with vaulted ceilings, rows of marble arches and columns in white, rose, grey and red stone, and polished floors in checkered dark and light granite. Huge crystal and brass chandeliers hang in the centre. Mosaics and stained glass panels showing heroic workers, soldiers, farmers and aviators in bright colours, bronze statues in alcoves, bas-relief carvings and gilded stars. Socialist realism and Stalinist classicism, theatrical lighting, symmetrical long perspective, warm golden light on polished marble, ornate ceiling coffers and sculpted ornament, like an underground cathedral or palace.'),
('Google Material Design','North America','2014-present','digital','In the style of Google Material Design, a clean, friendly digital interface built from flat layered sheets of paper with soft drop shadows suggesting elevation. Bright solid colour bars in indigo, teal, red or orange, a large round floating button casting a shadow, and white cards with rounded corners. Simple geometric icons with consistent line weight, a friendly humanist sans-serif typeface in clean sizes, generous white space, ripple animations spreading from the touch point, and bold colour blocks with white text. Sharp grids, even spacing, flat illustrations with limited colour. Cheerful, approachable and modern.'),
('Microsoft Fluent','North America','2017-present','digital','In the style of Microsoft Fluent, translucent frosted glass panels with a soft blur and fine noise texture floating over a coloured backdrop, rounded corner windows, subtle shadows, a fine light highlight that glows around controls under the cursor, and soft depth layering. Thin line icons or layered glyphs with soft colour gradients, a clean humanist sans-serif, centred icon bars, pastel gradient backgrounds in blue, violet and teal swirls, rounded toggle switches and pill buttons. Calm, airy and polished, with bright accent colours on neutral white or charcoal, like a late 2010s and 2020s software look.'),
('Windows 95 era interface','North America','1995-2000','digital','In the style of Windows 95 era interface, a flat teal green background, grey bevelled buttons and window frames with a raised 3D edge made of white highlight and dark grey shadow lines, a navy blue gradient title bar with white bold sans-serif text and tiny square control buttons, and a bar at the bottom with a raised start button bearing a four-colour waving flag mark. Chunky 32 pixel icons in a limited 16 colour palette with yellow folders, a bitmap typeface, dithered pixel patterns, light grey dialog boxes with sunken text fields and bevelled tabs, and a blocky retro beige-PC aesthetic.'),
('Early Mac OS interface','North America','1984-1990s','digital','In the style of Early Mac OS interface, a black and white one-bit bitmapped screen with a dithered grey checkerboard backdrop, windows with thin black borders and horizontal pinstripe title bars with a small square close box, drop shadows on the right and bottom edges, and a white menu bar across the top with black text. Chunky pixel icons, a smiling computer face, a rounded wide pixel typeface with friendly curvy letters, a wristwatch cursor, a pointer arrow and rounded button outlines. Charming, hand-crafted pixel art, crisp and clear monochrome.'),
('Nokia colour phones','Europe','1998-2003','electronics','In the style of Nokia colour phones, compact candy-bar handsets with a rounded plastic shell, a small monochrome greenish LCD screen with chunky pixel digits, a slightly raised grid of curved rubbery keys and a curved arch navigation key. Interchangeable snap-on faceplates in bold pop colours such as lime green, cyan blue, hot pink, orange, translucent clear, camouflage and glossy metallic, with printed pattern covers and soft rounded bases. Clean sans-serif numerals in white or blue, lightweight tough plastic, cheerful pop personalisation and an early mobile craze look.'),
('Swatch Memphis era','Europe','1980s','accessories','In the style of Swatch Memphis era, translucent or opaque plastic in bright primary and pastel colours with thin round faces, simple bold shapes and no clutter, and moulded plastic parts with perforated details. Surfaces are covered with confetti squiggles, triangles, zigzags, dots, lightning bolts, cubes, terrazzo speckle and grid patterns in clashing pink, turquoise, yellow, black, white and electric blue. Chunky geometric Postmodern graphics, bold black outlines, a playful, cheap-and-cheerful jelly look, and optimistic 1980s pop colours, shown tied in bunches or stacked up.'),
('Pantone','North America','1960s-present','color','In the style of Pantone, a square or rectangular colour chip with a flat solid swatch printed on glossy coated card, a white band along the bottom holding a small sans-serif code and the colour name in black capitals, and a thin white border. Numbered strips on long narrow cards bound at a rivet so the colours spread in a rainbow fan, tidy grids of colour squares in every hue arranged by tone. Clean neutral labelling, white background, consistent proportions, bold flat saturated colours such as vivid red, teal, violet and orange. A neat design-reference system with a catalogue feel.'),
('Shimano','East Asia','1980s-90s','bicycles','In the style of Shimano, precision-engineered mechanical components in polished or satin silver-grey aluminium with finely machined arms, sculpted teeth ramps and stamped steel linkages with shiny black plastic covers. Ergonomic combined hoods with rubber grips and stepped cogs. Laser-etched or screen-printed small capital text and model numbers, a blue or red logo on a silver ground, black and silver two-tone parts with polished highlights, small brightly coloured stickers and jewel-like precision. Clean industrial Japanese engineering from the 1980s and 1990s, with neat packaging in blue and white.'),
('Campagnolo','Europe','1960s-80s','bicycles','In the style of Campagnolo, classic Italian racing elegance in mirror-polished silver aluminium with scalloped and drilled arms, fine engraved script lettering, hollow barrels with long levers, and sculpted parallelogram bodies with tiny springs and slender arms. Tiny engraved lettering and a small winged wheel emblem, polished chrome bolts, hand-finished machining marks and jewel-quality metal. Shown beside lugged steel frames, leather and cotton details. Refined mid-century racing sophistication, shining silver against dark mountain roads.'),
('Brompton','Europe','1980s-present','bicycles','In the style of Brompton, compact, cleverly folding design of thin round steel tubes with hinged joints, a single curved main tube, small wheels, a tall telescoping post and a folded stem with a small rubber roller. Gloss paint in bold colours such as lime green, orange, turquoise, racing red, black and white, with chrome-bright hubs, brazed lugs and a front carrier block holding a canvas bag. Handmade British engineering, quirky, practical and urban, shown folded up into a neat cube, with a tidy minimalist appearance.'),
('Quiksilver','Oceania','1990s','surfwear','In the style of Quiksilver, bold tropical surf graphics with a logo of a stylised mountain peak overlapping a curling wave in a contrasting colour. Saturated electric blue, red, lime green and black with horizontal panel stripes, hibiscus flower prints, tribal flames, palm leaves and photographic ocean prints. Distressed screen-printed surf photos, hand-drawn lettering, painted brush strokes, sunburst graphics and chunky block lettering. Sun-bleached beach-bum mood of the early 1990s, loose baggy fits, nylon with contrast stitching and sandy colours with the sparkle of salt water.'),
('Burton','North America','1990s-present','sports','In the style of Burton, glossy graphic surfaces in clashing neon and black with bold graphics of skulls, flames, geometric prints, tropical foliage or solid colour, with a stylised cross-shaped mark or a bold white wordmark. Twin-tipped shapes with a slightly upturned nose, metal edges, stainless hardware, black or white plastic parts with padded straps and ratchet buckles, and oversized baggy garments with bright colour blocking. Snowy mountain terrain, bold 1990s snowboard culture, high energy, chunky boots and slick plastic gloss.'),
('Evinrude outboards','North America','1950s-60s','marine','In the style of Evinrude outboards, smooth rounded cowlings in two-tone paint of powder blue, seafoam green, cream or white with a bright accent stripe, a chrome plated handle, a streamlined hood with a front grille, and a gleaming stainless propeller below a fin-like lower unit. Raised capital letters and a stylised horse-shaped mark, chrome script text, chrome trim and bolts. Streamlined jet-age shapes inspired by fins, pastel enamel, a 1950s American lake-holiday look and a clean shine on the water.'),
('Dickies','North America','1920s-present','workwear','In the style of Dickies, durable twill workwear with sharp pressed creases down the leg, flat front, straight cut and high waist, in khaki, black, navy, charcoal and olive. Chest embroidered name patches in oval shape, bold sew-on logo labels, reinforced stitching and bar tacks. Smooth poly-cotton twill with a slight sheen, belt loops, sturdy fastenings and ankle-length hems. Clean, crisp and utilitarian, adopted by skaters and lowriders, with Californian blue-collar and street style and an iron-pressed neatness.'),
('Alpha Industries','North America','1950s-present','military','In the style of Alpha Industries, military-issue flight-jacket design with a bomber cut, glossy nylon outer in sage green, black, navy or midnight blue, and bright international orange lining that shows when reversed. Ribbed knit collar, cuffs and waistband, a heavy metal zip with a storm flap, a utility sleeve pocket near the shoulder, small sew-on tabs and subdued woven patches. Padded filling creating soft puffy quilting, lightweight, water-repellent, slightly crinkled finish. Surplus-store feel, stencilled lettering in a utilitarian military face, cold-war aviation heritage, practical and cool.'),
('Coleman','North America','1940s-60s','outdoor','In the style of Coleman, vintage camping gear in a distinctive olive green or sage baked enamel finish with cream or tan trim, glass globes, brass knobs, wire bail handles and ventilated metal caps. Hinged lids, chrome grates, steel tanks and rounded lids with swing handles. Red and white script logo and text on a small plate, a worn painted metal look with some rust and dents, and canvas in khaki. Postwar American family camping, nostalgic, sturdy, with rounded steel edges and a campfire glow.'),
('Snow Peak','East Asia','2000s-present','outdoor','In the style of Snow Peak, minimalist outdoor design in brushed titanium and stainless steel, with simple round forms, folding handles, elegant cast iron, slim stainless frames combined with bamboo or wood slats, and refined lanterns with a tidy conical shade. Muted olive, sand, grey and black canvas with clean architectural lines and tidy tension lines. A mark of a mountain peak within a sun, in small clean black or white print. Neat, stackable nesting design, understated Japanese craft, natural wood and metal, earth tones, precise tidy arrangement on a grassy site, quietly premium.'),
('Euro banknotes','Europe','2000s','currency','In the style of Euro banknotes, rectangular paper notes in distinct pastel colours per value such as grey, red, blue, orange, green, yellow and pale purple, increasing in size. Fronts show a classical arch, window or gateway on the left with a large numeral in the lower right and twelve small stars in a circle, backs show a bridge with a map. Architectural drawings of generic windows and doors from different historical periods in fine intaglio line work, microprint text, a holographic foil stripe or patch with shimmering gloss, a watermark window and an embossed ink feel. Soft pastel gradient backgrounds and clean sans-serif numerals.'),
('US dollar banknotes','North America','1900s-present','currency','In the style of US dollar banknotes, rectangular notes printed in black and green ink on cream cotton paper, with a central oval portrait of a statesman engraved in dense fine line work, ornate guilloche rosettes in each corner, scrollwork borders and a heavy numeral in the corners. A circular green seal with a ring of text, a black seal, serial numbers in green and black, a blackletter heading, microprinting and fine engraving, and on the reverse a green building vignette framed by a lace-like decorative border. Newer notes add pastel peach, blue or yellow tints and a colour-shifting numeral. Traditional engraving, banking authority and tradition.'),
('Brazil national football kit','Latin America','1970s-present','sports','In the style of Brazil national football kit, a canary yellow short-sleeve jersey with a green collar and green cuffs, paired with royal blue shorts with white trim and white socks with a green and yellow band. A shield crest with a green circle and stars sits on the left chest. Lightweight polyester with subtle woven patterns, wide v collars and retro cuts. Bright sunshine pitch scenes, samba crowds, vivid saturated tropical colours, simple clean panels, a joyful yellow, green and blue palette recognisable at any distance.'),
('All Blacks rugby','Oceania','1990s-present','sports','In the style of All Blacks rugby, a solid black heavy cotton or tight performance jersey with a white fold-over collar, black shorts and black socks with white turnover tops, and a white silver fern leaf emblem on the left chest. Matte textured fabric with a subtle tonal pattern, close fit with reinforced seams, sleek white trim and strips of text in white capitals. Stadium scenes with dark stands, spotlights and fog, powerful and stark monochrome black with silver detail, a rugged muddy pitch, intimidating minimal design, and a fern motif repeated in tonal print.'),
('Coca-Cola','North America','1900s-present','beverages','In the style of Coca-Cola, a vivid saturated red field with flowing white script lettering in a looping connected hand, underlined by a white ribbon swoosh or wave. Contour glass with a nipped waist, vertical fluted ribs, a bulging belly and a pale green-aqua tint, plus slim red and white metal cans, red cardboard packs and red trucks. Dynamic ribbon wave devices, white on red with occasional black or silver accents. Retro versions show round red metal signs, hand-painted wall adverts and rounded-corner red coolers. Clean, optimistic, high-contrast and instantly legible, with a cursive logotype as the hero.'),
('Pepsi','North America','1950s-present','beverages','In the style of Pepsi, a round globe emblem split into a red upper half and a blue lower half by a white wavy band, set against deep royal blue. Sans-serif lettering in bold lowercase or small caps, often placed beside or across the globe. Earlier versions used a bottle-cap shape with a serrated edge and a script wordmark in red on white. Bright blue fields with the globe tilted or smiling, silver tops, a palette of cobalt blue, bright red and white, a clean, youthful, pop-culture look, glossy metallic surfaces and sleek modern minimal variants in black.'),
]
